#: 6b8474e733064a9d9a81b8fcccb7f8e7
msgid "`Random Slab` 改的是边界条件和表面取向，结果会引入真空层与自由表面。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Slab` changes surface orientation and cell geometry, introducing "
"vacuum and free surfaces."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:140
#: 4c180c65150a4329ae53694b804f5dfd
msgid ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation` 改的是体相或表面内部的删位强度，不会自动生成表"
"面。"
msgstr ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation` removes sites from an existing bulk or surface "
"structure; it does not create a surface by itself."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:141
#: 8e683a46408b46b38b92b42983cb7fb6
msgid ""
"想研究“表面缺陷”，通常先 `Random Slab`，再 `Insert Defect` 或 `Vacancy "
"Defect Generation`。"
msgstr ""
"For surface defects, usually run `Random Slab` first, then `Insert Defect` "
"or `Vacancy Defect Generation`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:143
#: f77819cf6de047e5a5b81346d64f7aa9
msgid "随机掺杂 vs 成分空间采样 vs 随机占位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:145
#: 7c9a74255ca24e7388dfa28981923600
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` 负责定义“目标配比空间”，输出仍是带目标配比标签的"
"结构副本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:146
#: 094ec0641acb40e186557df3a50c570f
msgid "`Random Occupancy` 负责把目标配比真正落到离散原子位点上。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` realizes each target composition on discrete atomic sites."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:147
#: 7dee641070954881bfe7ae1f21441122
msgid ""
"`Random Doping` 更适合“给定规则后直接做一次随机替换”，而不是系统地扫完整配比"
"空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` is better for applying explicit random substitution rules "
"than for scanning a complete composition space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:149
#: ba569d095b984c7aba44719aa6606ca3
msgid "有序合金原型 vs 有限晶胞合金占位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:151
#: df31156a645f4cec9fd53cae730a431a
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype` 建立晶胞、周期边界、分数坐标和 A/B 晶体学子晶格，不"
"负责枚举组成。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype` creates the cell, periodic boundaries, fractional "
"coordinates, and crystallographic A/B sublattices; it does not enumerate "
"compositions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:152
#: 243baf1364d9461298240c014f8c7144
msgid ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` 接收已有位点或子晶格，先确定可实现的整数计数，"
"再生成不重复排布。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` accepts existing sites or sublattices, first "
"determines realizable integer counts, and then generates unique arrangements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:153
#: a0f28a96ef2347eb98a0370a3c878ec6
msgid ""
"要覆盖 L1₂、B2、L1₀ 的有序到部分无序路径，通常先生成原型，再做有限晶胞占位。"
msgstr ""
"To cover ordered-to-partially-disordered paths for L1₂, B2, and L1₀, "
"generate the prototype first and then apply finite-cell occupancy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:155
#: 8f16282658bb474aa6c2e45e35196480
msgid "原子扰动 vs 振动模式扰动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:157
#: 3468d7803feb495899cc1c3376512a5b
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` 是无模型的随机位移，适合快速补近平衡噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` adds model-free random displacements for quick near-"
"equilibrium augmentation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:158
#: cd3387058c6b4b799f8e653852fe08ec
msgid "`Vib Mode Perturb` 基于已有振动模态，适合更接近特定频率空间的位移采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` uses existing normal modes to sample selected regions of "
"vibrational-coordinate space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:159
#: 47fa377200df42d387f96cd110288465
msgid "输入里没有模态数组时，不能直接用 `Vib Mode Perturb`。"
