"for static initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:170
#: 8dc9c978e3984f86ad3063d4b422f333
msgid "`Magnetic Order` 会生成 FM / AFM / PM 等多磁态分支。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` branches into FM, AFM, and PM-like initial states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:171
#: 524bab19739e4f5cbb59fdb388956205
msgid ""
"`Magmom Rotation` 基于已有磁矩做角度扰动，适合补充非共线或局部旋转样本。"
msgstr ""
"`Magmom Rotation` perturbs existing directions and is suitable for local "
"noncollinear augmentation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:173
#: 3d6cf68905f74305a0f45d5653a79354
msgid ""
"磁性卡片对外统一使用 NEP / Show NEP 的 `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ 字段。卡片内部仍同步"
"维护 ASE 的 `initial_magmoms`，用于兼容 ASE 操作和旧工作流；导出文件只保留 "
"`spin`。读取已有磁矩时优先使用 `spin`，只有输入没有 `spin` 时才回退到旧的 "
"`initial_magmoms`。标量模式会按卡片中明确设置的 `Axis` 转成三分量 `spin`；零"
"向量 Axis 会明确失败，不会静默假设方向。"
msgstr ""
"Magnetic cards use the NEP / Show NEP `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ field as their "
"external contract. Internally, they also keep ASE `initial_magmoms` in sync "
"for ASE operations and legacy workflows; exported files retain only `spin`. "
"Existing moments are read from `spin` first and fall back to legacy "
"`initial_magmoms` only when `spin` is absent. Scalar mode converts values to "
"three-component `spin` vectors using the card's explicit `Axis`; a zero Axis "
"fails clearly instead of silently assuming a direction."

